message.content:
{
  "description": "The creature is shown in right-facing three-quarter view standing on a plain light background with a soft shadow beneath it. It has a low, elongated quadrupedal body with a broad, flat-snouted pale pinkish-beige head at the front and a long, thick tapering tail extending to the left rear. The dorsal surface from the back of the neck to the base of the tail is domed and covered in dense, overlapping large brown scales, while the head, sides, belly, limbs and tail are covered in pale, glossy, wrinkled skin with transverse folds. Six dark reddish-brown feathery branching structures protrude from the sides of the neck just behind the head, three per side. It stands on four stout limbs with broad clawed feet, and has large round eyes with golden-brown irises on the sides of the head.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "broad, flat and rounded at the snout, pale pinkish-beige with glossy wrinkled skin, small round nostrils at the tip, a slightly upturned mouth line, and large prominent round eyes with golden-brown irises, dark pupils and light blue-grey outer rings; skin on the crown shows faint darker mottling and small bumps",
      "where": "at the anterior end of the body, facing to the right, with the neck directly behind it where the feathery structures emerge"
    },
    {
      "part": "gills",
      "looks_like": "six external, feathery, branching gills, dark reddish-brown with a central stalk and numerous fine lateral filaments giving a fern-like appearance",
      "where": "three on each side of the head-neck junction, projecting outward and slightly backward from the skin just behind the head and above the forelimbs"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick, stout, fleshy limbs with pale pink wrinkled skin, visible skin folds at the elbows and knees, and a slightly glossy texture",
      "where": "two forelimbs positioned under the chest/shoulder region and two hindlimbs under the mid-body, all supporting the body above the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "broad, splayed feet with five short toes on each foot, each toe tipped with a small dark brown claw, pale pink wrinkled skin on the dorsal surface",
      "where": "at the distal end of each of the four legs, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, thick at the base and tapering to a point, pale pink wrinkled skin on the sides and underside with the dorsal base covered by overlapping scales, smooth tapering outline",
      "where": "extending posteriorly from the rear of the body to the left edge of the image"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "numerous large, overlapping, rounded to slightly pointed keratinous scales, brown with darker brown edges and fine concentric ridges, arranged in diagonal overlapping rows forming a continuous armor",
      "where": "covering the entire dorsal surface from just behind the gills over the domed back to the base of the tail"
    },
    {
      "part": "plates",
      "looks_like": "the same large, overlapping, curved keratinous plates as the scales, thick and imbricated, brown with darker margins, forming a domed dorsal armor",
      "where": "covering the back dorsally from the neck to the tail base, overlying the pale ventral skin"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "faint darker speckling/mottling on the top of the head and transverse wrinkled folds and creases on the pale ventral and lateral skin",
      "where": "mottling on the dorsal head surface, folds along the sides of the body, belly, and around the limb joints"
    }
  ],
  "attached_objects": [],
  "animals": [
    "axolotl",
    "pangolin"
  ],
  "separate_bodies": 1,
  "heads": 1,
  "walking_legs": 4,
  "wings": 0,
  "extra_limb_pieces": 0
}
